#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.calendar/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid "The month on Monet's glass, today on a dab of the sun"
msgstr "Monet 玻璃上的整月日历，今天以一抹阳光标出"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.clock/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Clock"
msgstr "时钟"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.clock/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid "The time and the date in the panel, and the month on a click"
msgstr "任务栏中的时间和日期，点一下可查看整月"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.frame/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Photo Frame"
msgstr "相框"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.frame/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid "Your pictures in a gilt frame, a new one every ten minutes"
msgstr "你的照片装在镀金相框里，每十分钟换一张"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.games/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Windows Games"
msgstr "Windows 游戏"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.games/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid ""
"Your Windows games as a gallery. Play restarts in Windows and comes back."
msgstr "以画廊形式展示你的 Windows 游戏。点“开始”会重启到 Windows，玩完再回来。"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.menu/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Menu"
msgstr "菜单"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.menu/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid ""
"Your pinned apps, every app from A to Z, and a search for apps, files and settings"
msgstr "你固定的应用、按 A 到 Z 排列的全部应用，还能搜索应用、文件和设置"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.notes/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Note"
msgstr "便签"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.notes/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid "A sheet of paper on the desktop, for what you want to keep in view"
msgstr "桌面上的一张纸，记下你想随时看到的内容"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.nowplaying/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Now Playing"
msgstr "正在播放"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.nowplaying/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid "What's playing, with its cover, on Monet's glass"
msgstr "在 Monet 的玻璃上显示正在播放的内容和封面"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.placard/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Placard"
msgstr "展签"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.placard/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid ""
"The time, the date and the painting's name, like the card next to a painting"
msgstr "时间、日期和画作名称，就像画作旁的说明卡"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.played/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Recently Played"
msgstr "最近玩过"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.played/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid ""
"The games you played last, with their covers: one click and you're back in"
msgstr "你最近玩过的游戏和封面：点一下，马上回到游戏"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.quick/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Quick Settings"
msgstr "快捷设置"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.quick/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid "Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, sound, brightness and Monet's light in one place"
msgstr "Wi-Fi、蓝牙、声音、亮度和 Monet 的光线，集中在一处"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.system/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "System"
msgstr "系统"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.system/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid ""
"How hard your PC is working: the processor, the graphics and the memory, how warm they run, and what's downloading"
msgstr "你的电脑有多忙：处理器、显卡和内存，它们有多热，还有正在下载的内容"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.timer/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Timer"
msgstr "计时器"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.timer/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid ""
"A few minutes on the sun's path: for the tea, a break, or one more match"
msgstr "沿着太阳的轨迹走过几分钟：泡一壶茶、歇一会儿，或再来一局"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.weather/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "Weather"
msgstr "天气"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.weather/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid "The sky where you are, painted on Monet's glass"
msgstr "你所在地的天空，画在 Monet 的玻璃上"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.worldclock/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "World Clock"
msgstr "世界时钟"

#: linux/share/plasma/plasmoids/org.monet.worldclock/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid ""
"The time in other towns, each on a little clock face, light by day and dark by night"
msgstr "其他城市的时间，每座城市一个小表盘，白天浅色，夜晚深色"

#: linux/share/plasma/wallpapers/org.monet.hours/metadata.json
msgctxt ""
"the name of a part of Monet (a widget, a style, a painting) in KDE's lists"
msgid "The Hours"
msgstr "时光"

#: linux/share/plasma/wallpapers/org.monet.hours/metadata.json
msgctxt "what a part of Monet is, in KDE's lists"
msgid "One harbor in four lights, drifting through the day"
msgstr "一座港口，四种光线，随一天流转"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:211 crates/monet/src/main.rs:299
msgid ""
"Windows isn't installed yet. Choose Windows in the app menu to finish setting it up."
msgstr "Windows 尚未安装。在应用菜单中选择 Windows 即可完成设置。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:213
msgid ""
"Windows is encrypted with BitLocker, so Monet can't set it up for you. In Windows, open Monet for Windows and run Install Monet."
msgstr ""
"Windows 已使用 BitLocker 加密，因此 Monet 无法替你设置。请在 Windows 中打开 Monet for Windows，然后运行 Install Monet。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:218
msgid ""
"Windows is asleep, so Monet can't set it up yet. Open Windows, choose Restart, and Monet finishes the rest."
msgstr "Windows 正处于休眠状态，因此 Monet 暂时无法设置它。请打开 Windows，选择“重启”，剩下的交给 Monet。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:226
msgid "This PC didn't start in UEFI mode, so Monet can't switch to Windows."
msgstr "这台电脑没有以 UEFI 模式启动，因此 Monet 无法切换到 Windows。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:233 crates/monet/src/main.rs:512
msgid ""
"Windows wasn't found on this PC. Install Windows first, then try again."
msgstr "这台电脑上找不到 Windows。请先安装 Windows，然后重试。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:253
msgid "Not found"
msgstr "未找到"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:255
msgid "Unavailable (not a UEFI system)"
msgstr "不可用（不是 UEFI 系统）"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:309
msgid "Play %1 on Windows?"
msgstr "要在 Windows 中玩 %1 吗？"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:310
msgid "Play on Windows?"
msgstr "要在 Windows 中玩吗？"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:314
msgid ""
"Your PC will restart in Windows and start the game. When you quit, it comes back to Monet."
msgstr "你的电脑将重启到 Windows 并启动游戏。退出游戏后，会回到 Monet。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:315
msgid "Your PC will restart in Windows. Open apps will close."
msgstr "你的电脑将重启到 Windows。打开的应用会关闭。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:516
msgid ""
"Monet seems to have started from the Windows entry, which shouldn't happen."
msgstr "Monet 似乎是从 Windows 启动项启动的，这不应该发生。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:548
msgid ""
"This PC's firmware didn't keep the switch to Windows. Restart and choose Windows in the PC's boot menu."
msgstr "这台电脑的固件没有保留切换到 Windows 的设置。请重启，然后在电脑的启动菜单中选择 Windows。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:580
msgid "The restart was blocked. Restart your PC to continue in Windows."
msgstr "重启被阻止了。请重启电脑以继续进入 Windows。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:668
msgid "This copy of Monet can't install Windows by itself."
msgstr "这个版本的 Monet 无法自行安装 Windows。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:690
msgid "Getting Windows ready for your games"
msgstr "正在为你的游戏准备 Windows"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:692
msgid ""
"Monet is downloading Windows (about 7 GB). You can keep using your PC; Monet asks before it restarts."
msgstr "Monet 正在下载 Windows（约 7 GB）。你可以继续使用电脑，Monet 重启前会先问你。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:708
msgid ""
"Monet can install Windows from %1. Your PC restarts and Windows installs itself."
msgstr "Monet 可以从 %1 安装 Windows。电脑会重启，然后 Windows 会自行安装。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:711
msgid ""
"Windows isn't installed yet. Monet downloads it from Microsoft (about 7 GB) and installs it. This takes about 30 minutes."
msgstr "Windows 尚未安装。Monet 会从 Microsoft 下载（约 7 GB）并安装它，大约需要 30 分钟。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:715
msgid "Set up Windows?"
msgstr "要设置 Windows 吗？"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:715
msgid "Set Up"
msgstr "开始设置"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:739
msgid ""
"Restart now to install Windows? It takes about 10 minutes, then you're back in Monet."
msgstr "要立即重启来安装 Windows 吗？大约需要 10 分钟，之后会回到 Monet。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:747
msgid ""
"Microsoft didn't allow the automatic download. Download Windows 11 from Microsoft's page (choose \"Download Windows 11 Disk Image (ISO)\"), keep it in Downloads, then choose Windows again."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft 不允许自动下载。请从 Microsoft 的网页下载 Windows 11（选择“下载 Windows 11 磁盘映像 (ISO)”），保存在“下载”文件夹中，然后再次选择 Windows。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:749
msgid "Download Windows"
msgstr "下载 Windows"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:749
msgid "Open Microsoft's Page"
msgstr "打开 Microsoft 网页"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:757
msgid "there isn't enough free space for Windows"
msgstr "没有足够的可用空间来安装 Windows"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:758
msgid ""
"Windows needs about 72 GB of the disk to itself, and 16 GB free in Monet while it downloads."
msgstr "Windows 需要独占约 72 GB 的磁盘空间，下载期间 Monet 中还需要 16 GB 可用空间。"

#: crates/monet/src/main.rs:763
msgid ""
"Windows couldn't be set up this time. Choose Windows in the app menu to try again."
msgstr "这次没能设置好 Windows。请在应用菜单中选择 Windows 重试。"

#: crates/monet/src/trip.rs:252
msgid ""
"Windows didn't start: this PC skipped Monet's one-time start. Next time, Monet asks it a different way."
msgstr "Windows 没有启动：这台电脑跳过了 Monet 的一次性启动。下次 Monet 会换一种方式请求。"

#: crates/monet/src/trip.rs:262
msgid ""
"Windows didn't start: this PC couldn't open its boot entry. Next time, Monet uses another one."
msgstr "Windows 没有启动：这台电脑无法打开它的启动项。下次 Monet 会改用另一个。"

#: crates/monet/src/trip.rs:264
msgid ""
"Windows didn't finish starting. Choose Play again to continue. If it happens again, open Settings, then Play on Windows, and choose Check."
msgstr "Windows 未能完成启动。再选一次“开始”即可继续。如果再次发生，请打开“设置”，然后进入“在 Windows 中玩”，选择“检查”。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/disk.rs:119
msgid ""
"Windows didn't let Monet write to the USB stick. Take it out, put it back in, and try again."
msgstr "Windows 不允许 Monet 写入 U 盘。请拔出 U 盘，重新插入，然后重试。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/disk.rs:139
msgid ""
"Writing to the USB stick failed. Try another USB port or another stick."
msgstr "写入 U 盘失败。请换个 USB 接口或换个 U 盘试试。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/disk.rs:147
msgid "The USB stick didn't keep what was written. Try another stick."
msgstr "U 盘没能保存写入的内容。请换个 U 盘试试。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/disk.rs:164
msgid "The USB stick stopped answering."
msgstr "U 盘没有响应了。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:82
msgid "Make a Monet USB stick stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "“制作 Monet U 盘”意外停止了。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:83 crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:114 crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:134
#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:187 crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:328 crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:345
msgid "Make a Monet USB stick"
msgstr "制作 Monet U 盘"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:136
msgid ""
"Monet %1 installs from a USB stick of 2 GB or more. Choose the stick: everything on it is erased."
msgstr "Monet %1 需要用 2 GB 或更大的 U 盘来安装。请选择 U 盘：上面的所有内容都会被清除。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:142
msgid "Make USB stick"
msgstr "制作 U 盘"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:176
msgid "Plug in a USB stick (2 GB or more)."
msgstr "请插入 U 盘（2 GB 或以上）。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:186
msgid ""
"Everything on %1 will be erased.\n"
"\n"
"Make it a Monet USB stick?"
msgstr ""
"%1 上的所有内容都将被清除。\n"
"\n"
"要将它制作成 Monet U 盘吗？"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:205
msgid "Writing to the USB stick…"
msgstr "正在写入 U 盘…"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:211
msgid "Writing the USB stick · %1 of %2 GB"
msgstr "正在写入 U 盘 · %1 / %2 GB"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:213
msgid "Checking the USB stick · %1 of %2 GB"
msgstr "正在检查 U 盘 · %1 / %2 GB"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:232
msgid ""
"This Windows can't download Monet by itself: it needs Windows 10 (2018) or newer."
msgstr "这个版本的 Windows 无法自行下载 Monet：需要 Windows 10（2018 年版）或更新版本。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:241
msgid "Getting ready to download Monet…"
msgstr "正在准备下载 Monet…"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:250 crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:293
msgid ""
"Monet couldn't be downloaded. Check the internet connection, then try again: it picks up where it stopped."
msgstr "无法下载 Monet。请检查网络连接，然后重试：下载会从中断处继续。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:276
msgid "Downloading Monet · %1 of %2 GB"
msgstr "正在下载 Monet · %1 / %2 GB"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:278
msgid "Downloading Monet · %1 GB"
msgstr "正在下载 Monet · %1 GB"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:283
msgid "about %1 min left"
msgstr "大约还剩 %1 分钟"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:290
msgid "The connection dropped. Picking up where it stopped…"
msgstr "网络连接断开了。正在从中断处继续…"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:322
msgid ""
"Your Monet USB stick is ready.\n"
"\n"
"Restart this PC with it plugged in, and choose the USB stick in the PC's boot menu."
msgstr ""
"你的 Monet U 盘已制作完成。\n"
"\n"
"插着 U 盘重启这台电脑，然后在电脑的启动菜单中选择这个 U 盘。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:330
msgid "Done."
msgstr "完成。"

#: crates/monet-usb/src/gui.rs:345
msgid "The USB stick isn't finished. Stop anyway?"
msgstr "U 盘还没有制作完成。仍要停止吗？"
